Chapter: NoiseAnalysis
  cites Foreword chapter List

 Noise analysis for circuit simulation. Calculates thermal noise,
 shot noise, and flicker (1/f) noise contributions from each
 component and produces a total noise spectral density plot.

Section: Noise Source

  NoiseSourceType =
    | NoiseThermal
    | NoiseShot
    | NoiseFlicker
    | NoiseRts

  NoiseSource = record {
    ns-element : Text,
    ns-type : NoiseSourceType,
    ns-spectral-density : Real,
    ns-corner-freq : Real
  }

  noise-type-name : NoiseSourceType -> Text
  noise-type-name (t) = when t
    is NoiseThermal -> "thermal"
    is NoiseShot -> "shot"
    is NoiseFlicker -> "1/f"
    is NoiseRts -> "RTS"

Section: Noise Result

  NoisePoint = record {
    np-frequency : Real,
    np-total-density : Real,
    np-integrated-noise : Real
  }

  NoiseContribution = record {
    nc-element : Text,
    nc-noise-type : NoiseSourceType,
    nc-density : Real,
    nc-percentage : Real
  }

  NoiseResult = record {
    nr-output-node : Text,
    nr-reference-node : Text,
    nr-points : List NoisePoint,
    nr-contributions : List NoiseContribution,
    nr-total-rms : Real,
    nr-point-count : Integer,
    nr-contribution-count : Integer
  }

  empty-noise-result : Text, Text -> NoiseResult
  empty-noise-result (output) (ref) = NoiseResult {
    nr-output-node = output,
    nr-reference-node = ref,
    nr-points = [],
    nr-contributions = [],
    nr-total-rms = 0.0,
    nr-point-count = 0,
    nr-contribution-count = 0
  }

  noise-add-point : NoiseResult, NoisePoint -> NoiseResult
  noise-add-point (r) (p) = NoiseResult {
    nr-output-node = r.nr-output-node,
    nr-reference-node = r.nr-reference-node,
    nr-points = list-push r.nr-points p,
    nr-contributions = r.nr-contributions,
    nr-total-rms = r.nr-total-rms,
    nr-point-count = r.nr-point-count + 1,
    nr-contribution-count = r.nr-contribution-count
  }

  noise-add-contribution : NoiseResult, NoiseContribution -> NoiseResult
  noise-add-contribution (r) (c) = NoiseResult {
    nr-output-node = r.nr-output-node,
    nr-reference-node = r.nr-reference-node,
    nr-points = r.nr-points,
    nr-contributions = list-push r.nr-contributions c,
    nr-total-rms = r.nr-total-rms,
    nr-point-count = r.nr-point-count,
    nr-contribution-count = r.nr-contribution-count + 1
  }

Section: Thermal Noise

 Johnson-Nyquist thermal noise spectral density for a resistor.
 V_n^2 = 4kTR, where k = 1.380649e-23 J/K, T = temperature in K.

  thermal-noise-density : Real, Real -> Real
  thermal-noise-density (resistance) (temperature-k) =
    4.0 * 0.00000000000000000000001380649 * temperature-k * resistance

Section: Shot Noise

 Shot noise spectral density for a diode junction.
 I_n^2 = 2qI, where q = 1.602176634e-19 C, I = DC bias current.

  shot-noise-density : Real -> Real
  shot-noise-density (dc-current) =
    2.0 * 0.0000000000000000001602176634 * dc-current

Section: Noise Summary

  noise-summary : NoiseResult -> Text
  noise-summary (r) =
    "Noise analysis at " & r.nr-output-node & " (ref: " & r.nr-reference-node & "): " & (show r.nr-point-count) & " frequency points, " & (show r.nr-contribution-count) & " noise sources"
